cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "openevolve-bedrock: Amazon Bedrock as the LLM backend for OpenEvolve"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/scttfrdmn/openevolve-bedrock"
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Scott
abstract: >-
  A provider plugin that runs OpenEvolve, an open-source implementation of the
  AlphaEvolve evolutionary coding architecture, against Amazon Bedrock models
  via the Converse API or Bedrock's OpenAI-compatible endpoints, with a
  per-call usage ledger and cost-to-result reporting.
keywords:
  - OpenEvolve
  - AlphaEvolve
  - Amazon Bedrock
  - evolutionary computation
  - large language models
references:
